"The + at the left of the notch's top row starts a tab in a folder you pick: your login shell goes to the folder, then runs the command, so your PATH and the agent's own sign-in apply. Each tab is a widget on the dashboard that opens into its terminal, and it keeps running while the notch is closed. After Scout restarts the tabs come back by themselves, each in its folder, and the agents continue with the resume command; with that switched off they wait under + › Resume instead." = "Tosaíonn an + ar chlé de bharrchlár an notch cluaisín i bhfillteán a roghnaíonn tú: téann do login shell chuig an bhfillteán, ansin ritheann sé an t-ordú, mar sin baineann do PATH agus logáil isteach an ghníomhaire féin. Is giuirléid ar an bpainéal é gach cluaisín a osclaíonn ina theirminéal agus a choinníonn ag rith agus an notch dúnta. Tar éis Scout a atosú, filleann na cluaisíní astu féin, gach ceann ina fhillteán, agus leanann na gníomhairí ar aghaidh leis an ordú atosaithe; nuair a bhíonn sin as, fanann siad faoi + › Lean ar aghaidh.";
"The 8-bit look, light or dark, colours, sizes and styles." = "An chuma 8-bit, éadrom nó dorcha, dathanna, méideanna agus stíleanna.";
"The 90s look: pixel agents, chunky keys, LCD digits." = "Cuma na 90idí: gníomhairí picteilíní, eochracha tiubha, digití LCD.";
"The Mirror widget. Video never leaves your Mac." = "Giuirléid an Scátháin. Ní fhágann físeán do Mac riamh.";
"The Prompter sits right under the camera and is hidden from screen sharing and recordings. Steady scrolls at a set speed: ↑ and ↓ (or scrolling) change it, Space pauses, Esc closes." = "Suíonn an Prompter díreach faoin gceamara agus tá sé i bhfolach ó chomhroinnt scáileáin agus ó thaifeadtaí. Scrollaíonn Seasta ar luas socraithe: athraíonn ↑ agus ↓ (nó scrollú) é, cuireann Space sos air, dúnann Esc é.";
"The archive is too big for a ZIP file (4 GB limit)" = "Tá an chartlann ró-mhór do chomhad ZIP (teorainn 4 GB)";
"The camera runs only while the Mirror tab or widget is on screen. The camera key under the picture copies a picture of it to the clipboard; Share makes a polaroid with your agents and shows it before anything is shared. macOS asks for camera access the first time you press the button to turn it on. External and iPhone cameras show up in the list." = "Ritheann an ceamara nuair a bhíonn cluaisín nó giuirléid an Scátháin ar an scáileán amháin. Cóipeálann an cnaipe ceamara faoin bpictiúr pictiúr de chuig an ngearrthaisce; déanann Comhroinn polaroid le do ghníomhairí agus taispeánann sé é sula gcomhroinntear aon rud. Fiafraíonn macOS faoi rochtain ar an gceamara an chéad uair a bhrúnn tú an cnaipe chun é a chur air. Feictear ceamaraí seachtracha agus iPhone sa liosta.";
"The clipboard history." = "Stair an ghearrthaisce.";
"The countdown appears next to the notch and shows the title when you rest the pointer on it. Zoom, Google Meet, Teams and Webex links get a Join button." = "Feictear an comhaireamh síos in aice leis an notch agus taispeánann sé an teideal nuair a chuireann tú an pointeoir air. Faigheann naisc Zoom, Google Meet, Teams agus Webex cnaipe Isteach.";
