"The icons along the open notch: click one and it opens; the dashboard tab goes back. They start left of the camera and carry on to its right; the Mirror always stands right of it. The lock key next to the gear keeps the tab you are on as the one the notch opens on, instead of the dashboard; press it again to let go. At least one tab stays on." = "Na deilbhíní feadh an notch oscailte: cliceáil ar cheann agus osclaíonn sé; téann cluaisín an phainéil ar ais. Tosaíonn siad ar chlé den cheamara agus leanann siad ar dheis air; seasann an Scáthán ar dheis air i gcónaí. Coinníonn an eochair ghlasála in aice leis an ngiar an cluaisín a bhfuil tú air mar an ceann a osclaíonn an notch air, in ionad an phainéil; brúigh arís chun é a scaoileadh. Fanann cluaisín amháin ar a laghad air.";
